Hah, hah!  I've never encountered Orcus before.  
When I got down to his level:  "Invisible Orcus drinks a potion of gain
level!  Invisible Orcus rises up through the ceiling!"
When I get back up a level:  "The death ray whizzes by you.  The death
ray bounces.  The death ray destroys Orcus!"  One more demon personality
trashed, and a death wand into the bargain.  Yeehaw!  Score one more
for Caveman Oog XXV.

But seriously, maybe the Dev Team should think about making their
unique monsters a little bit smarter, so they don't kill themselves
like that.  Orcus ought to know that his wand of death should only be aimed
diagonally in an enclosed space!!
